#11500
"Rutted Road through a Copse"
"Running along the ivy-covered stone walls of a tower to the west, this small
dirt road slopes slightly downward as it runs north through this small copse,
meeting trees to the north, and then turning west.  Low, dense woods line the
the path to the east.  Deep ruts and a hardened central portion in the still-
soft dirt of the road mark the passage of many carts and teams.  The air is
slightly misty and the ground damp and a river can be heard running to the
northwest.
"
"[Nereus] Hello, cathedral being constructed!
[Nereus] This is going to be the first iteration of the cathedral.  As it goes through building phases, we'll swap out the later versions so it looks like the cathedral is undergoing a continual construction.
